# The open-data API (apps/dados). Development needs none of these: `bun run db:roles` writes the
# connection string into apps/web/.dev.vars and it is read from there.
# "production" won't start until the instance names an openDataLicence.
DADOS_MODE=
# The fala_dados role, which reads only the `dados` views. Any other role is refused.
DADOS_DATABASE_URL=
PORT=3400
